# The leak checks' CodeQL queries, run on our code and on vendored code alike.
# go-security-and-quality is the stock suite that has both halves: the memory
# queries (allocation size overflow, uncontrolled allocation size, integer
# conversion) are tagged security, and the correctness ones (index out of
# bounds, shift out of range, unhandled file close, and so on) are tagged
# quality. Its maintainability queries are style, which isn't ours to fix in
# someone else's module, and in our code ineffassign and staticcheck already
# catch the same useless assignments.
- description: Leak, memory, and correctness queries for Go
- import: codeql-suites/go-security-and-quality.qls
  from: codeql/go-queries
- exclude:
    tags contain: maintainability
